  "ALL_TEXT": "30 INT. VEDA'S HOUSE - NIGHT \nWe hear someone's steady breath in the dark, the jingle of \nkeys and some barely audible whispers. Someone opens the door \nstealthily; three men tip-toe in. They go to the bedside. One \nof them switches off the fan, another pulls out a knife and a \nlighter. We hear slurping and licking noises. VEDA, in his \n20s, wakes up. The lights are turned on, three people scream \n\u201cHappy Birthday raa Mama\u201d. VEDA stares at them for five whole \nseconds, blinking, trying to make sense of the situation. One \nof the three is BHANU, his roommate, wearing torn clothes, \nwith an empty bottle of whiskey in his hand. \nVEDA \nNaa birthday aypoyi six months \nayyindhi \nBHANU \nNee chetha cake cut cheyisthe maa \ncelebrations aipoyinatte. \nVISHAL, also in his 20s, is wearing a baby sling (without a \nbaby) across his chest. \nVISHAL \nMamma idhigo chaaku, adhigo cake-u \ncut chey. \nVEDA looks at VISHAL and asks \nVEDA \nVeedevadura? \nBHANU \nNaa best friend raa... \nVEDA \nPaerenti? \nBHANU calmly turns to VISHAL and asks \nBHANU \nPaerenti mama? \nVISHAL \nVISHAL raa \nBHANU \nAha, VISHAL gadu. Nuvvu koye. \nBHANU looks at VEDA blankly, not realizing the farcical \nnature of the situation. VEDA rolls his eyes and looks at \nHARSHA, who is asleep on VEDA's floor, half sitting, half \nresting against the wall. BHANU pulls out a pastry with a \ncandle on it and looks at VEDA. \nBHANU \nAbba cake koye. \nBHANU blows the candle and holds VEDA's hand and makes him \ncut the pastry. The rest of them sing the birthday song. \nhalf-broken, half-slurring. Suddenly, VEDA lifts his leg from \nthe floor, seeing a PUG trying to lick his foot. BHANU looks \ndown at the PUG, picks it up and shoves it onto VEDA's hands. \nBHANU \nAa macha! Marchipoya idhigo ne \nbirthday gift. \nVEDA \nIdhentra? \nBHANU \n(matter of fact response) \nKukkara, bochhu leni hutch kukka. \nNeeke. \nVISHAL \nMaku peggu niku puggu. \nVEDA \nAedho thayda koduthundhi \nBHANU straps out the baby sling from VISHAL's chest and gives \nit to VEDA \nBHANU \nIdhigo unkoka gift... \nVEDA \n(irritated) \nGet out rascals. Pani paata ledhu. \nRathirlu janaalni disturb \ncheyadaaniki baildherutharu \noorimeeda ki. \nBHANU \n(pissed) \nAntavu ra antavu..friends ani kuda \nchudakundaa..potham ra \npotham..randra... \nBHANU pacifies the crying VISHAL, and throws a credit card at \nVEDA. \nBHANU \nThesko..malli prodhunavaraku room \nki osthey adugu \nVEDA looks at the clock, which shows 5:00 a.m. \nVEDA \nRey idhi..idhi..naa card raa...nee \ndhaggarikela vachindhi? \nBHANU \n(pissed) \nMorning I borrowed it \nVEDA \nAdigi theskunte borrow \nraa..adakkunda thiskunte \ndhobbeyadam antaruu \nBHANU \nEdichav..bodi card. Okka party ke \nlimit challe. \nVEDA \nRey..limit 30 veluraa!! \nNARRATOR (V.O.) \nIthanu oo pedda software \nengineer... \n(sarcastically) \nokappudu. Ippudu paedha software \nengineer. Yeppatiki bench meeda \nvundalanukunnaadu.. Kaani company \nbenche laagesindi..anthey. Aa \nbhadhalonchi therukune lopu \nkudhirina pelli cancel ayyindhi. \nNARRATOR (V.O.) \nPelli kudhirindhanna santhosham lo \npartylu, shoppinglu antu cardulu \nviparithanga geekadu..appula \nbaadha, recovery agents gola \nperigipoyindhi, dhaaniki thodu \nthagubothu roommate dorikina \ndabbulu dorikinattu \nethukelthaadu..ippudu karchulaki \ndabbulu levu, gikadaaniki cardulu \nlevu, by the way..peru Veda \nShankar. \nFREEZE FRAME \nCUT TO: ",
